    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Bright Release"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(fire, light)\n\nWhen a bright walker is reduced to 0 Hit Points, they flash out in a burst of light, obtaining the blazing end they were denied at death. This blaze deals 10d6 fire damage (25 basic Reflex save) to creatures within 20 feet. Creatures who fail this save are also dazzled for 1 minute (blinded for 1 minute on a critical failure)."
            },
            "id": "1f9662f5-6c06-4474-8c62-f39886ab5629",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:49.513693"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Light Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, light)\n\n30 feet. The bright walker sheds bright light. Any creature that starts its turn in the aura must attempt at a 24 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is temporarily immune for 24 hours.\n- **Success:** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 hour."
            },
            "id": "87c83f61-0619-4845-ad89-962017807043",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:49.513693"
            }
          }
        },
